\begin{abstract}
  We propose and prove an existential theorem for entanglement-assisted
  asymmetric quantum error correcction. Then we demonstrate its superiority
  over the conventional one.
\end{abstract}

\begin{keywords}
  Asymmetric quantum error correction,
  Entanglement-assisted quantum error correction, 
