The first implementation is in place and the planted witness verifies at all four presets. The shipping instance keeps the answer at 63 field elements while increasing the ambient code length and transvection data; its small demo has exactly one normalized witness by exhaustive enumeration. I’m now timing the disclosed Gaussian baseline and running the full adversary/canonicalization gates.
