+        f"  <(x|z),(x'|z')> = sum_r (x_r z'_r - z_r x'_r) mod {q}.",
+        "The X-weight (respectively Z-weight) is the number of nonzero x "
+        "(respectively z) coordinates.",
+        "",
+        f"There are ell={ell}=2*{c}+1 canonical rows b^0_0,...,b^0_{ell-1}.",
