The required harness received HTTP 403: `Key limit exceeded (total limit)` on every retry, yielding zero scored oracle attempts. Consequently, the hinted/placebo transcripts were not fabricated and no `REJECTED.md` was written.

Please raise or replace `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`’s total limit, then I can resume the bare, hinted, and placebo runs.
